{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2826160/extras/14b4d86a115e8265143ff144bf1c83c8.avif?t=1771783800\" width=956 height=269 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Danmaku Fighters is a fast-paced 2D bullet hell fighting game with a fresh feel. Choose your favorite character from a wide selection and battle against other players online!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2826160/extras/e5d42f76dc116144f2e05bc74b325540.poster.avif?t=1771783800\" width=1170 height=656 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2826160/extras/e5d42f76dc116144f2e05bc74b325540.webm?t=1771783800\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2826160/extras/e5d42f76dc116144f2e05bc74b325540.mp4?t=1771783800\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DF's battles are straightforward: each game consists of several rounds, each lasting 60 seconds. Each round, both players fire Danmakus at each other from their own area. The player who got hit loses 1 HP, ending the round. The game ends when either player's HP reaches zero. You can also learn more about the game in the tutorial mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your favorite character and join the world of DF now!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2826160/extras/774f0588f2f8f5be6f626aed6b829c54.avif?t=1771783800\" width=956 height=269 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High-speed, exciting 1v1 bullet hell battles are available both online and offline!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rollback network makes online battles smoother!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A tutorial mode makes learning the game easy!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A complete built-in character move list lets you quickly understand character abilities!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supports keyboard or controller play, with customizable bindings!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A practice mode where you can freely explore character strategy and skill combinations!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A random matchmaking mode where you can battle against players from all over the world!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 unique characters, each with its own playstyle, allow you to show your creativity, and more characters will be added soon!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2826160/extras/39fbee10e5ceeea0620200ceecb76ff0.poster.avif?t=1771783800\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2826160/extras/39fbee10e5ceeea0620200ceecb76ff0.webm?t=1771783800\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2826160/extras/39fbee10e5ceeea0620200ceecb76ff0.mp4?t=1771783800\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2826160/extras/b62709d22bd132d6fea4c0ccdd73f37d.avif?t=1771783800\" width=956 height=269 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In DF, each character not only has a different appearance but also a completely different gameplay style!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your favorite character's appearance or playstyle to compete for victory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2826160/extras/7b248370c858d56533ba39f3df8e7727.poster.avif?t=1771783800\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2826160/extras/7b248370c858d56533ba39f3df8e7727.webm?t=1771783800\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2826160/extras/7b248370c858d56533ba39f3df8e7727.mp4?t=1771783800\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Currently, there are 8 unique characters in the game:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Takkiya, the mysterious second prince of the Sea Kingdom, can summon sea creatures to aid him in battle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jessica, a dazzling street magician who attacks with ever-changing magic.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leon, a professional exorcist who summons spirits and chants sacred incantations to enhance himself.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wesker, a bounty hunter who breaks the rules by utilizing diverse tools and combat experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Miumiu, a martial artist proficient in ground combat, switches between 5 animal forms.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >XX, an unknown entity who creates objects on the field and brings the laws of the universe into play.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Calvary, the diligent office worker and Grim Reaper who commands little angels in battle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >WiF3, a combat robot from the future equipped with high-tech weapons.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More characters will be added in the future!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2826160?t=1771783800","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2826160?t=1771783800","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2826160/1e34898847355cfcef29e481b82ccb82c4b6a9d7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771783800","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2826160/1e34898847355cfcef29e481b82ccb82c4b6a9d7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771783800","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2826160/extras/14b4d86a115e8265143ff144bf1c83c8.avif?t=1771783800\" width=956 height=269 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Danmaku Fighters is a fast-paced 2D bullet hell fighting game with a fresh feel. Choose your favorite character from a wide selection and battle against other players online!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2826160/extras/e5d42f76dc116144f2e05bc74b325540.poster.avif?t=1771783800\" width=1170 height=656 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2826160/extras/e5d42f76dc116144f2e05bc74b325540.webm?t=1771783800\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2826160/extras/e5d42f76dc116144f2e05bc74b325540.mp4?t=1771783800\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DF's battles are straightforward: each game consists of several rounds, each lasting 60 seconds. Each round, both players fire Danmakus at each other from their own area. The player who got hit loses 1 HP, ending the round. The game ends when either player's HP reaches zero. You can also learn more about the game in the tutorial mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your favorite character and join the world of DF now!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2826160/extras/774f0588f2f8f5be6f626aed6b829c54.avif?t=1771783800\" width=956 height=269 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High-speed, exciting 1v1 bullet hell battles are available both online and offline!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rollback network makes online battles smoother!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A tutorial mode makes learning the game easy!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A complete built-in character move list lets you quickly understand character abilities!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supports keyboard or controller play, with customizable bindings!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A practice mode where you can freely explore character strategy and skill combinations!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A random matchmaking mode where you can battle against players from all over the world!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 unique characters, each with its own playstyle, allow you to show your creativity, and more characters will be added soon!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2826160/extras/39fbee10e5ceeea0620200ceecb76ff0.poster.avif?t=1771783800\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2826160/extras/39fbee10e5ceeea0620200ceecb76ff0.webm?t=1771783800\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2826160/extras/39fbee10e5ceeea0620200ceecb76ff0.mp4?t=1771783800\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2826160/extras/b62709d22bd132d6fea4c0ccdd73f37d.avif?t=1771783800\" width=956 height=269 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In DF, each character not only has a different appearance but also a completely different gameplay style!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your favorite character's appearance or playstyle to compete for victory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2826160/extras/7b248370c858d56533ba39f3df8e7727.poster.avif?t=1771783800\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2826160/extras/7b248370c858d56533ba39f3df8e7727.webm?t=1771783800\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2826160/extras/7b248370c858d56533ba39f3df8e7727.mp4?t=1771783800\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Currently, there are 8 unique characters in the game:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Takkiya, the mysterious second prince of the Sea Kingdom, can summon sea creatures to aid him in battle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jessica, a dazzling street magician who attacks with ever-changing magic.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leon, a professional exorcist who summons spirits and chants sacred incantations to enhance himself.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wesker, a bounty hunter who breaks the rules by utilizing diverse tools and combat experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Miumiu, a martial artist proficient in ground combat, switches between 5 animal forms.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >XX, an unknown entity who creates objects on the field and brings the laws of the universe into play.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Calvary, the diligent office worker and Grim Reaper who commands little angels in battle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >WiF3, a combat robot from the future equipped with high-tech weapons.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More characters will be added in the future!</p>","developers":["Baby Bear Fish"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2826160/5d924ec20eea3cab81ddaaa03ea23af1e3f7c778/header.jpg?t=1771783800","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2826160/1231567817/51010acf38053a5affe7235699ead9573041ab7f/1769949724/dash_av1.mpd?t=1769963627","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2826160/1231567817/51010acf38053a5affe7235699ead9573041ab7f/1769949724/dash_h264.mpd?t=1769963627","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2826160/1231567817/51010acf38053a5affe7235699ead9573041ab7f/1769949724/hls_264_master.m