ting game. Choose your favorite character, and fight against other players in online play!","steam_appid":2826160,"support_info":{"email":"babybearfish1340@gmail.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"English, Traditional Chinese, Simplified Chinese, Japanese","type":"game","website":null}